     1091        LABEL "Создал"
     1092         VIEW-AS TEXT
     1093        SIZE 15 BY .67
     1094        FGCOLOR 4  NO-UNDO.
     1095   DEFINE QUERY BROWSE-ABC FOR
     1096         x-abcxyz-analysis SCROLLING.
